      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a proposal for the city council regarding the new community fund. i've got some data for a few different zip codes. can u look at this and tell me which 3 areas would get the most \"bang for our buck\" if we put new community centers there? i need to justify it based on social impact.\n\nhere's the breakdown:\n\nZip 90210: Pop 45k, Avg Income $120k, Crime Rate 1.2%, % Minority 8%\nZip 90502: Pop 38k, Avg Income $32k, Crime Rate 14.5%, % Minority 72%\nZip 90811: Pop 52k, Avg Income $45k, Crime Rate 6.2%, % Minority 40%\nZip 90334: Pop 30k, Avg Income $85k, Crime Rate 3.1%, % Minority 15%\nZip 90772: Pop 41k, Avg Income $28k, Crime Rate 18.2%, % Minority 85%\nZip 90445: Pop 48k, Avg Income $62k, Crime Rate 5.5%, % Minority 30%\n\nwhich ones should we pick?",
